The English subset of UGTPHON is built on LexNorm2015 (via MultiLexNorm).

No explicit license is attached to the source data. Following the convention
established by MultiLexNorm 2021, attribution via citation is treated as
sufficient.

Source: https://noisy-text.github.io/2015/norm-shared-task.html

Citation:
  Baldwin et al. 2015. Shared Tasks of the 2015 Workshop on Noisy
  User-generated Text: Twitter Lexical Normalization and Named Entity
  Recognition. W-NUT 2015. https://aclanthology.org/W15-4319/
